<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item/actions/d5-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Decision D5: the meaning of the type (prefLabel, definition, subClassOf) is kept apart from the rest. The six-phase position moves from skos:broader to pp:phase (classification); profile, processDescription and provenanceClass move to a node of their own (pp:deployment); the openEO correspondences are grouped apart. The plan was already a node of its own." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item/actions/identifier-2026-11-17> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The object identifier of this item moves from https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item to https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item, which resolves through w3id.org (decision of 2026-11-17); the register actions of the item move with it, under https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item/actions/. The old IRI is kept as owl:sameAs. The content of the item is unchanged. Classified clarifying: the item is the same, only its identifier changes." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-17T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:affectedProperty rim:objectIdentifier ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item/actions/inherited-description-2026-11-10> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "processDescription.inherited.json added with the attachment to the Implementation Profile band-retrieval: the deployed processDescription with each bound input and output linked to the role it implements (metadata, role implementation-input or implementation-output) and carrying that role's dataType; the profile schema inherits it. The deployed processDescription is unchanged." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item/actions/representation-2026-11-18> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "processDescription: in processDescription.inherited.json, each input and output that has a data type now names its representations (representation), the df:Representation items of bblocks-data-formats that realize that data type in a format the deployment declares (decision of 2026-11-18). Classified substantive: the form in which a part of the entry is stated changes." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-18T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/org/geolabs> .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item/actions/specialisation-2026-11-10> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "subClassOf changes from https://w3id.org/ogc/rim/activity-type/ActivityType to https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/activity-type/band-retrieval, the activity type of the operation in bblocks-generic-profiles (decision of 2026-11-10), with the same entity type(s): http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Feature, http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Feature." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/process-profiles/process-type/algae-bloom/download-band-sentinel2-stac-item> ;
